Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.92,0:00:02.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wealth, Fame, Power.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:01.73,0:00:03.73,Credits-480p,,90,0,60,,{\alpha&H10&\an7\fad(600,200)\fs35}Editing{\r}\NFeeso
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.08,0:00:04.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gold Roger, the King of the Pirates,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:03.73,0:00:05.73,Credits-480p,,90,0,60,,{\alpha&H10&\an7\fad(600,200)\fs35}Timing{\r}\NKaitouYahiko
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.74,0:00:07.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,attained this and everything\Nelse the world had to offer,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:05.73,0:00:09.73,Credits-480p,,90,0,60,,{\alpha&H10&\an7\fad(600,600)\fs35}Quality Control{\r}\NFeeso\NGalaxy 9000\NPepperjack\NSewil\NTheFVguy
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.38,0:00:10.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and his dying words drove\Ncountless souls to the seas.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:09.73,0:00:11.73,Credits-480p,,90,0,60,,{\alpha&H10&\an7\fad(600,600)\fs35}Soundtracking{\r}\NHalee
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.80,0:00:12.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You want my treasure?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:11.73,0:00:13.73,Credits-480p,,90,0,60,,{\alpha&H10&\an7\fad(600,600)\fs35}Graphics{\r}\NDatenshi
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.28,0:00:13.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can have it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.72,0:00:16.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I left everything I gathered\Ntogether in one place.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:13.73,0:00:15.73,Credits-480p,,90,0,60,,{\alpha&H10&\an7\fad(600,600)\fs35}Karaoke{\r}\NKaitouYahiko
Dialogue: 1,0:00:15.73,0:00:17.73,Credits-480p,,90,0,60,,{\alpha&H10&\an7\fad(600,600)\fs35}Translation{\r}\NGaijin\NFUNimation
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.96,0:00:19.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now you just have to find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.02,0:00:24.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These words lured men to\Nthe Grand Line in pursuit
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.38,0:00:26.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of dreams greater than\Nthey'd ever dared to imagine.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.56,0:00:29.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is a time known as\Nthe Great Pirate Era.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.46,0:00:35.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come aboard and bring along\Nall your hopes and dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.62,0:00:40.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Together we will find everything\Nthat we're looking for.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.76,0:00:42.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One Piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.66,0:00:52.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Compass left behind,\Nit'll only slow us down.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.70,0:00:55.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your heart will be your guide.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.44,0:00:58.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Raise the sails and take the helm.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.64,0:01:01.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That legendary place.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.28,0:01:03.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That the end of the map reveals.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.96,0:01:06.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is only legendary.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.92,0:01:10.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Until someone proves it real.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.26,0:01:12.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Through it all.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.74,0:01:14.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Through all the trouble of times.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.60,0:01:16.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Through the heartache\Nand through the pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.96,0:01:19.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Know that I will be there.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.70,0:01:21.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To stand by you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.44,0:01:24.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just like I know you'll stand by me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.30,0:01:28.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So come aboard and bring along.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.38,0:01:30.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All your hopes and dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.50,0:01:33.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Together we will find everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.02,0:01:36.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That we're looking for.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.22,0:01:39.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's always room for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.82,0:01:42.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you wanna be my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.20,0:01:46.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We are, we are on a cruise.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.44,0:01:49.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We are.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:50.33,0:01:57.26,Title-480p,,0,0,160,,{\fad(800,800)}The Town of Beginnings and Endings
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.06,0:01:58.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've raised your prices again?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.40,0:02:03.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a little steep, don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.46,0:02:08.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Raise your prices again\Nand I'll stop paying.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.52,0:02:14.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the big deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.98,0:02:16.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just one paper.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.38,0:02:17.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just one paper?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.48,0:02:18.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I buy these every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.70,0:02:19.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.84,0:02:21.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but there's no need to\Nsave every last berry
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.90,0:02:24.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so you can buy back your\Nvillage from Arlong,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.14,0:02:24.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.05,0:02:27.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can finally stop\Nobsessing about money.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.34,0:02:28.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're so stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.74,0:02:32.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that all that stuff's over,\NI'm saving money for me now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.66,0:02:38.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jeez, I'm not gonna be one of those poor\Npirates who can't even afford to dress up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.62,0:02:39.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.24,0:02:43.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm in the middle of developing\Nmy special Tabasco star.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.46,0:02:49.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,An eye full of this\Nwill make any bad guy...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.02,0:02:55.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.60,0:02:57.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just want one of them!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.76,0:02:58.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.67,0:03:00.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is Nami's tangerine orchard!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.62,0:03:02.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't let anyone lay a finger on it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.96,0:03:06.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nami, can you see how well\NI'm protecting your trees?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.06,0:03:08.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, you're doing very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.00,0:03:12.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, Sanji's getting\Nused, that poor bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.36,0:03:17.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I only want one tangerine.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.96,0:03:19.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just give it here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.42,0:03:20.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're so mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.02,0:03:21.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.14,0:03:24.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, well.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.50,0:03:25.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm pretty happy anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.42,0:03:30.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The world's sure a turbulent place.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.02,0:03:33.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They just had another coup in Villa.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.66,0:03:36.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.46,0:03:41.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.02,0:03:43.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah! Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.30,0:03:44.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.20,0:03:46.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:54.42,0:03:58.46,Captions-480p,,50,0,350,,{\fad(500,0)}Navy Headquarters \NOperated by the \NWorld Government
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.16,0:04:09.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.10,0:04:12.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,even a conservative\Nestimate of their power
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.78,0:04:15.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,says they're too much for\Nour branches to handle?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.12,0:04:16.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.08,0:04:18.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even before forming his pirate group,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.70,0:04:21.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he defeated Marine Branch\NCaptain Axe Hand Morgan,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.36,0:04:23.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,which he did single-handedly.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.24,0:04:26.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And since then, he's showed\Nno signs of slowing down.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.42,0:04:29.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Buggy the Clown, 15 million.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.10,0:04:33.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pirate Fleet Commodore\NDon Krieg, 17 million.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.54,0:04:36.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fishman Pirate Sawtooth,\NArlong, 20 million.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.92,0:04:41.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These pirates were big players, and they\Nhad bounties of over 10 million berries.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:37.13,0:04:46.01,Captions-480p,,0,0,5,,{\fad(400,400)}Commander Brannew\NNavy Headquarters
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.46,0:04:45.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By comparison, the average\Nbounty is only 3 million berries.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.00,0:04:47.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He took them down.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.28,0:04:53.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's true that 30 million berries as a\Nstarting bounty is globally unprecedented.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.52,0:04:55.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But in my opinion, it's necessary.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.98,0:04:59.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's best to destroy such\Nseeds of villainy early on,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.56,0:05:02.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,before they've had a\Nchance to get out of hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.54,0:05:04.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Absolutely.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.40,0:05:09.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, guys, we're wanted criminals!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.20,0:05:12.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a whole lot of money!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.08,0:05:14.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Check it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.99,0:05:16.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be seen all around the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.82,0:05:18.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These girls might even fall for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.54,0:05:19.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.45,0:05:21.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They put Long Nose in but left me out?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.06,0:05:23.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.00,0:05:25.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't see you anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.54,0:05:26.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.74,0:05:30.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the back of your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.50,0:05:31.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's not so great.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.74,0:05:33.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aw, don't be so glum.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.66,0:05:36.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't have to be a captain to get\Nyour picture on one of these things.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.94,0:05:38.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? Is that true?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.44,0:05:40.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, just work really hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.18,0:05:45.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go to the Grand Line, men!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.68,0:05:50.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yet again, you guys don't understand\Nhow grim our situation really is.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.30,0:05:54.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This means all of our lives\Nwill be in constant danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.42,0:05:59.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, this is no time to be\Nrelaxing in the East Blue.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.48,0:06:05.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,30 million berries.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.14,0:06:08.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At that amount, I bet\Nheadquarters will take action!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.32,0:06:11.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not to mention there'll be\Nbounty hunters to deal with.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.98,0:06:15.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And with this kind of\Nbounty, they'll be good.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.86,0:06:20.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Miss?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.80,0:06:25.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Miss Kaya!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.58,0:06:28.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Miss, it's amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.32,0:06:29.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mary, what's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.92,0:06:31.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have you seen this, flyer?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.96,0:06:34.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, it's Usopp!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.62,0:06:38.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See, that's definitely\NUsopp facing the other way!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.36,0:06:40.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.18,0:06:42.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.34,0:06:49.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Finally!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.25,0:06:52.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy, you're finally living your dream!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.62,0:06:54.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm Monkey D.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.88,0:06:57.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy, and I'm gonna\Nbe king of the pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.12,0:07:02.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.78,0:07:08.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if we meet again,\Nwe will meet as enemies.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.96,0:07:44.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're getting closer.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.76,0:07:47.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've almost made it to the Grand Line.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.42,0:07:50.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a famous city on this\Nisland known as Loguetown.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.90,0:07:52.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Loguetown?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.36,0:07:55.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm pretty sure I've heard of it before.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.32,0:07:58.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the city of the\Nbeginning and the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.88,0:08:03.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the town where the old\NKing of the Pirates, Gold Roger,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.58,0:08:05.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,was both born and killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.20,0:08:11.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's where the Pirate King died.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.62,0:08:14.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.02,0:08:16.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, let's do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.96,0:08:19.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This was the man who had the One Piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.80,0:08:24.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everything the world has to offer, I need\Nto see where he was born and executed.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.20,0:08:40.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you wish to flee, then do so now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.42,0:08:45.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We owe the passion of peace in this\Nworld, and weakness will not be tolerated.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.18,0:08:48.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The feeble public counts on us.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.90,0:08:50.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We alone are the righteous ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.14,0:08:54.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If there is evil on the\Nseas, then we, the Marines,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.06,0:08:57.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,must drive it away with\Nthe utmost prejudice.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.86,0:09:01.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In the name of absolute peace!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.52,0:09:04.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.22,0:09:09.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Woo-hoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.14,0:09:10.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is going to be so fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.88,0:09:15.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Every pirate headed to the Grand\NLine stops here to resupply.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.86,0:09:18.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It has everything you could possibly need.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.56,0:09:21.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If that's the case, then I'm\Ngoing to go on a shopping spree.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.88,0:09:24.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll bet they have all\Nsorts of stuff here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.34,0:09:26.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be able to stock up on fresh produce.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.32,0:09:28.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And fresh women.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.92,0:09:31.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'd think there'd be a\Nswordsmith around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.14,0:09:32.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought you were broke.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.94,0:09:34.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you going to steal a sword?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.42,0:09:38.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm going to find\Nout where they kill people.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.42,0:09:39.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.33,0:09:42.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got to see where the King\Nof the Pirates was executed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.70,0:09:43.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.78,0:09:45.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to pick a meeting place!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.10,0:09:48.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's not good.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.42,0:09:54.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The King of the Pirates was\Nborn and executed in this town.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.94,0:09:59.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I could be running in his very\Nfootsteps right now. Yahoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.30,0:10:04.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These swords are all\Nso freaking expensive.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.56,0:10:06.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure, I'll lend you some money.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.18,0:10:09.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That'll just be 300% interest.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.26,0:10:14.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't afford to borrow any\Nmore money from that girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.42,0:10:17.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I can't go to the grand\Nline stuck with just one sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.84,0:10:19.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's got to be a way.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.58,0:10:20.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Monster, how rude.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.96,0:10:22.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.14,0:10:25.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our boss is behind bars\Nbecause of you and your
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.50,0:10:28.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,idiot of a captain Haven't\Nyou learned your lesson?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.74,0:10:29.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Definitely not.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.82,0:10:31.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guess we need you to teach us again!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.86,0:10:33.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're supposed to bring your corpse to our
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.98,0:10:36.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,boss so he can see that\Nwe finished you off.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.32,0:10:39.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you insist, I will fight you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.08,0:10:41.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's really very funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.34,0:10:43.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You do know you're a girl, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.18,0:11:07.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, she did it! That was awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.24,0:11:16.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's good with a sword,\Nbut not so good at walking.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.92,0:11:18.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.70,0:11:19.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.86,0:11:21.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.52,0:11:24.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.43,0:11:25.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's so kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.12,0:11:28.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,May I have my glasses?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.46,0:11:31.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How do I look?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.58,0:11:34.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You look absolutely engaging. And now...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.80,0:11:37.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Artistically extravagant. This?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.16,0:11:42.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Considuously elevated, acrimoniously\Naltered, artificially executed,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.86,0:11:45.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,may I deliver these to your lodgings?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.48,0:11:48.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No thanks, a little too\Nexpensive for my taste.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.02,0:11:50.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you, come back soon!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.02,0:11:53.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, a perfect aperitif.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.18,0:11:56.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Coupled with two\Nmouth-watering delicacies?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.66,0:12:01.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, with so much on the menu,\NI can't decide where to start.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.94,0:12:04.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I wish this was a buffet.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.90,0:12:08.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, I think I just\Nfound the main course!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.40,0:12:14.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, crazy!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.92,0:12:17.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think I've died and\Ngone to trinket heaven!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.66,0:12:18.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come in, come in!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.84,0:12:21.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In our humble store,\Nalmost everything you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.46,0:12:23.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is a near priceless pirate artifact.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.26,0:12:25.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,from Adventure to the Grand Line.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.28,0:12:28.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am certain you will not find a\Nstore like this in the entire world.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.58,0:12:31.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So then, everything in this store\Nhas been to the Grand Line and back?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.62,0:12:32.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that what you're telling me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.70,0:12:34.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are so observant.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.56,0:12:38.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We only accept a certain type of clientele\Nin this establishment, you might imagine.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.42,0:12:42.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I can tell by your demeanor\Nthat you're my type of client.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.04,0:12:43.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Observe!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.95,0:12:45.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hold in my hands a gun that was once the
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.44,0:12:48.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,favorite of none other than\NTHE Gold Roger! No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.92,0:12:51.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gold Roger's gun? Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.38,0:12:53.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just breathe, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.70,0:12:54.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's more to come.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.78,0:12:57.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Show me everything! Right this way!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.16,0:13:04.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, hold on, excuse\Nme, where are we going, i
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.62,0:13:07.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,still can't believe that\Nyou broke my glasses.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.08,0:13:12.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I told you i'll pay you\Nback okay jeez you'll pay
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.76,0:13:15.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,me back you don't look\Nlike you have any money.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.24,0:13:19.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Am i right well that's\Ntrue i am kind of broke
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.58,0:13:22.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,i knew it i can tell by\Nthe look on your face.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.96,0:13:24.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that you're pretty desperate.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.34,0:13:25.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.25,0:13:26.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your sick mother needs medicine?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.88,0:13:29.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or did your wife run\Naway with another man?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.10,0:13:30.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And leave you all alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.14,0:13:31.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to raise the children by yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.00,0:13:33.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.32,0:13:34.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't explain.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.60,0:13:35.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just come with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.16,0:13:42.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Marines.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.20,0:13:46.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.68,0:13:49.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once you start working for the\NMarines, you'll never have to worry?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.36,0:13:51.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,about money problems ever again.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.26,0:13:52.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not a chance in hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.56,0:13:54.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't work for Marines.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.54,0:13:55.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't leave now!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.94,0:13:58.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I expect to be paid back for my glasses.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.94,0:13:59.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.58,0:14:02.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sergeant Major, it's time for training.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.04,0:14:04.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be back to check on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.52,0:14:06.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's a sergeant?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.50,0:14:12.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Crap, this is gonna\Ntake the whole damn day!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.20,0:14:14.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unless...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.52,0:14:18.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Three mop technique work like a charm.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.64,0:14:23.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One more time!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.58,0:14:31.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.70,0:14:33.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just what do you think you're doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.20,0:14:34.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.11,0:14:35.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Zoro, the pirate hunter.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.24,0:14:37.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are you cleaning?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.78,0:14:40.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Intel says you've teamed up with Monkey D.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.88,0:14:41.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy's crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.26,0:14:44.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Drop the mop!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.02,0:14:51.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.56,0:14:53.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guess I should leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.88,0:14:58.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What happened here?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.14,0:15:04.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They appear to have been attacked, but\Nthere's no sign of who's responsible.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.94,0:15:09.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,New glasses.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.26,0:15:16.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Man, that was just too weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.76,0:15:18.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She looked just like Conney.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.14,0:15:22.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not to mention she was a\Nswordsman of all things.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.56,0:15:23.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A crazy world.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.72,0:15:25.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I doubt I'll ever see her again.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.74,0:15:35.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd like to pick up some swords.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.68,0:15:38.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course, of course. Welcome.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:36.87,0:15:43.50,Captions-480p,,0,0,5,,{\fad(500,0)}Ipponmatsu\NWeapons Merchant
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.42,0:15:41.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have a look at anything you'd like.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.22,0:15:44.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have an extremely large\Nvariety to choose from.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.36,0:15:48.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got 100,000 berries for\Ntwo swords. Can you do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.16,0:15:50.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Two for 100,000?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.64,0:15:52.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.55,0:15:53.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This guy is broke.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.48,0:15:58.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For $50,000 apiece, I can only\Ngive you two dollar blades.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.20,0:16:00.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can make do with whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.80,0:16:03.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just don't have the money right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.42,0:16:06.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't make do with whatever\Nunless you're an amateur.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.18,0:16:08.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.46,0:16:10.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That sword! Could it be?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.16,0:16:13.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, no, no, hold on a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.30,0:16:15.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just want to take a look\Nat that sword you got there.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.86,0:16:17.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that okay with you, pal?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.80,0:16:19.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You okay there, buddy?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.74,0:16:21.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me see! Yeah, whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.84,0:16:26.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is really it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.92,0:16:28.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stay cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.20,0:16:30.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Poker face!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.40,0:16:31.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Poker face!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.64,0:16:35.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A complete amateur just walked\Nin with a legendary sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.02,0:16:37.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's showtime!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.06,0:16:40.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, that's a pretty nice sword you got.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.64,0:16:41.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You want to sell it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.64,0:16:43.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll give you 200,000 berries for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.62,0:16:44.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.53,0:16:47.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That will leave you with 300,000, which\Nshould buy you some pretty good steel.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.86,0:16:51.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At $100,000 a piece, there are bound\Nto be three swords you like in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.82,0:16:52.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.73,0:16:54.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you kidding me? All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.06,0:16:58.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll give you $250,000. No, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.36,0:16:59.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,$300,000.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.10,0:17:02.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Buy the law for $500,000. Just stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.88,0:17:03.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not selling.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.92,0:17:05.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The sword is mine. Tough guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.94,0:17:08.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll buy it from you for 650,000 belly!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.78,0:17:11.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, fine. I give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.74,0:17:14.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How does $800,000 berries sound to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.60,0:17:15.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm back!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.78,0:17:17.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you finish polishing my shigure?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.82,0:17:20.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.73,0:17:22.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was worried about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.14,0:17:24.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See, some marines were\Nattacked earlier, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.78,0:17:27.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By where you had been mopping\Nthe floors, you were gone though,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.34,0:17:29.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so naturally I just assumed\Nthat you had been kidnapped.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.76,0:17:30.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank goodness.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.78,0:17:32.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's not very bright.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.18,0:17:35.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The fact that you're here means\Nyou must have run away. Sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.06,0:17:39.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You really must have no idea how to\Naccept love when it comes your way.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.08,0:17:39.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.99,0:17:41.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So here's your stupid money back.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.52,0:17:42.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't need it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.43,0:17:45.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't accept money from\Na heartless and great.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.42,0:17:48.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Besides, look, I already\Ngot some new glasses.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.88,0:17:53.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That sword looks just\Nlike the Wado Ichimonji.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.46,0:17:56.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is this really the sword?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.08,0:17:57.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wado?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.22,0:18:00.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop talking! Stop talking!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.92,0:18:04.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's beautiful!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.46,0:18:07.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This has to be one of\Nthe 21-O-Wazamono swords.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.34,0:18:10.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See? Look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.96,0:18:14.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It says here that this sword is worth\Nno less than 10 million berries.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.62,0:18:15.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you're broke.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.88,0:18:17.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How do you have this legendary sword?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.70,0:18:18.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.61,0:18:20.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You just had to keep talking, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.10,0:18:23.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to sue your ass\Nfor obstruction of business.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.16,0:18:24.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Obstruction of business?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.36,0:18:25.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.32,0:18:27.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know what I did,\Nbut please forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.02,0:18:30.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here, I've finished polishing\Nyour precious shigure for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.96,0:18:32.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now just take it and get out.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.38,0:18:34.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't want to see you in my store again.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.28,0:18:39.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just get out before you\Ntear my store apart!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.20,0:18:41.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.88,0:18:44.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did she ever help you dodge a bullet?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.50,0:18:47.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is a complete waste to\Nhave such a legendary sword
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.20,0:18:50.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,attached to someone who has\Nno idea of its true value.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.24,0:18:54.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You could pick from our lovely selection\Nof barrel swords for $50,000 apiece.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.52,0:18:55.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pick any two you like.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.60,0:18:58.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is that guy's problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.40,0:19:02.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You must lose a lot of swords if you think\Nyou have to carry three of them around.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.56,0:19:05.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unless, of course, you're like\Nthat famous pirate hunter.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.46,0:19:06.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pirate hunter, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.80,0:19:08.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's quite the legend.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.20,0:19:09.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His name is Roronoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.66,0:19:11.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah, him. Yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.70,0:19:14.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he's known throughout the East\NBlue for his amazing sword skills,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.68,0:19:16.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but he's not a good person.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.44,0:19:20.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A swordsman who is just a bounty hunter\Nis no honorable swordsman at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.38,0:19:21.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everything's backwards.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.64,0:19:23.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's really too bad for real swordsmen.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.04,0:19:28.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pirates and bounty hunters as swordmasters,\Nit just doesn't make any sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.30,0:19:31.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They have most of the world's\Nlegendary swords, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.64,0:19:33.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a real tragedy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.88,0:19:36.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.04,0:19:40.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the kind of thing you have to look\Nat on a case-by-case basis, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.38,0:19:42.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You never know what people are capable of.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.28,0:19:43.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is my Shigure.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.56,0:19:46.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to work as hard as\NI can to perfect my skills,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.18,0:19:48.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and then one day I'll take\Nback all the legendary swords?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.76,0:19:51.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,because the filthy hands that hold\Nthem now have no right to wield them.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.06,0:19:58.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, the 21 top Owazumonos, the 21\NOwazumonos, as well as the Ryo-Wazumonos.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.76,0:20:00.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll find them all.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.62,0:20:04.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And this one, my sword,\Nthe Wado Ichimonji.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.62,0:20:11.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,uh i'm not trying to get the legendary\Nswords back for my sake i just
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.78,0:20:13.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,don't want criminals to have them
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.60,0:20:18.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,this
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.06,0:20:21.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,sword is i
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.84,0:20:23.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,think that's let's see
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.18,0:20:32.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,just as i thought kitetsu kitetsu the\Nthird its predecessor kitetsu the second is
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.10,0:20:37.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,an owazumono And Kitetsu the first before\Nthat is listed as a top Owazumono sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.64,0:20:41.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, are you really only selling\Nthis one for 50,000 berries? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.90,0:20:43.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unbelievable.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.90,0:20:45.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's an authentic Wazumono.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.18,0:20:48.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, you have to buy that sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.34,0:20:51.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's worth at least a\Nmillion berries or more.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.96,0:20:53.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't pass it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.36,0:20:54.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's too valuable.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.60,0:20:55.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.51,0:20:56.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't sell it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.52,0:20:57.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.80,0:20:59.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I knew there must have been some mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.74,0:21:00.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is a legendary sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.06,0:21:02.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not what you think.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.56,0:21:13.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The swords are cursed.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.02,0:21:20.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,do you know just do the
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.30,0:21:22.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kitetsu swords are\Nsuperior in all respects?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.94,0:21:24.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But they've been cursed\Nsince their beginnings
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.02,0:21:28.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you have to believe me there are stories
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.84,0:21:31.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,from All over a master\Nswordsman Who have met
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.36,0:21:33.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,their death after taking\Nup a Kitetsu sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.88,0:21:37.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nobody is stupid enough to\Neven touch them these days.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.22,0:21:40.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you'll fall to its curse as\Nwell if you decide to take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.18,0:21:43.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm scared to let you buy it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.14,0:21:44.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid it'll curse me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.98,0:21:46.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just leave it alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.80,0:21:47.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How horrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.12,0:21:50.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry I even brought it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.16,0:21:52.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It would be death to take that sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.52,0:21:55.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sounds great.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.70,0:21:56.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Think I'll take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.58,0:21:59.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't sell it, You fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.44,0:22:01.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because if something happens\Nto you with that sword,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.78,0:22:03.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the curse could come back to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.96,0:22:05.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't be an idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.16,0:22:06.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let him buy that sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.28,0:22:07.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You old fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.19,0:22:08.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't hit me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.28,0:22:09.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, we'll see
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.54,0:22:16.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How about we find out which one is\Nstronger the swords curse or my good luck?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.38,0:22:26.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop it you're gonna chop\Nyour arm off you fool
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.24,0:22:46.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.42,0:22:54.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, pick out another.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.96,0:22:58.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, okay. You! Wait here!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.46,0:23:09.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is covered in a black lacquer finish
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.64,0:23:11.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,with an uneven temper pattern.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.00,0:23:18.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My shop is small, but this\Nis the finest sword I have.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.66,0:23:21.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is named the Rio Azamono Yubashiri.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.50,0:23:22.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I told you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.76,0:23:25.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm flat broke. It's too much. No matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.94,0:23:28.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll give it to you free of\Ncharge if you'll take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.34,0:23:30.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're welcome to the Kitetsu as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.42,0:23:31.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You deserve it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.68,0:23:34.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Haven't run across a real\Nswordsman in a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.10,0:23:36.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry I tried to cheat you before.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.22,0:23:38.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You must have some damn good luck, friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.08,0:23:50.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I definitely feel better\Nhaving three swords again.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.46,0:23:51.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.80,0:23:55.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't buy me anything nice, but\Nyou can give away our best sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.36,0:23:58.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That sword belongs in the\Nhands of a true swordsman.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.40,0:24:06.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,here why don't you take out the garbage\Nyes ma 'am that's weird who was that guy
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.32,0:24:18.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,what's that yeah let me see
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.88,0:24:28.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.60,0:24:29.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Answer me, Hawkeye?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.80,0:24:31.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.28,0:24:33.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where is your leader?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.44,0:24:35.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My business is with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.64,0:24:39.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Camping out on an island.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.34,0:24:41.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a carefree man!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.88,0:24:46.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boss!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.20,0:24:53.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.68,0:25:00.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,H-H-H-H-HawkEye!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.28,0:25:07.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey there, Hawkeye.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.84,0:25:09.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To what do I owe the pleasure?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.80,0:25:11.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have you come to fight me?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.50,0:25:14.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because you know, I'm not\Nfeeling so good at the moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.50,0:25:17.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that you've lost your left arm.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.62,0:25:20.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have no intention of settling the score!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.82,0:25:24.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I recently found an interesting pirate.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.40,0:25:27.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seeing him reminded me of\Na story you used to tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.66,0:25:30.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A story about a boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.58,0:25:33.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A strange boy from a small village.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.94,0:25:44.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha, ha, Luffy, you made it.
Dialogue: 1,0:25:46.56,0:25:49.44,Captions-480p,,0,0,160,,{\fad(400,0)} Captain "Red-Haired" Shanks\NRed Hair Pirates
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.92,0:25:49.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right then, Hawkeye, in that case.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.52,0:25:54.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid I can't let\Nyou just leave. Not now.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.10,0:26:02.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hawkeye! Drink them!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.28,0:26:05.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go on, till they're back!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.36,0:26:06.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a celebration!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.88,0:26:09.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Weren't you hungover?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.30,0:26:10.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no way! Not anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.64,0:26:13.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Drink, drink, drink!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.52,0:26:14.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Drink it!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.08,0:26:16.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's it!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.60,0:26:19.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everybody!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.68,0:26:20.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's get drunk!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.40,0:26:22.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but wait, boss!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.84,0:26:26.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought you said you felt like crap\Nbecause you drank too much last night!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.28,0:26:27.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't be stupid!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.56,0:26:30.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't not drink on a\Njoyous day like today!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.22,0:26:31.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But the sun is still hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.14,0:26:33.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't sweat it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.54,0:26:35.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time to party.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.82,0:26:42.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you hear the news?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.16,0:26:43.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy's a wanted man now.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.92,0:26:44.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.70,0:26:46.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I'll be.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.68,0:26:49.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A great pirate came from\Nour tiny little village.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.14,0:26:50.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, who would have thought?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.62,0:26:54.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shut up, you boneheads. Mr. Mayor?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.40,0:26:58.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's so great about a Newgate\Ncriminal coming from our little village?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.44,0:26:59.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.86,0:27:03.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bunch of jerks.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.62,0:27:04.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.74,0:27:08.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just look at him, Mayor.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.56,0:27:09.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He looks so happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.44,0:27:12.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A pirate's a pirate.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.18,0:27:17.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will make it as a pirate, and\Nthen I'll be king of the pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.00,0:27:20.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You see, Luffy's achieved his dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.84,0:27:22.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hasn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.36,0:27:25.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His dream
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.38,0:27:27.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.22,0:27:31.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.

